{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_59", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": 174, "width": 1048, "height": 474, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1128488134, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1210883261, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_60", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 190, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17581914, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 625675343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - TWO LISTS, ONE PIPE", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - TWO LISTS, ONE PIPE", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_61", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 226, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1799361520, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1585932014, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Fresh distressed-owner records and agents sitting on aged or off-market listings get pulled on the same schedule, then merged into one queue\nwith a seller or agent tag. Two campaigns, one system, nobody uploads a CSV.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Fresh distressed-owner records and agents sitting on aged or off-market listings get pulled on the same schedule, then merged into one queue\nwith a seller or agent tag. Two campaigns, one system, nobody uploads a CSV.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_62", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1144, "y": 182, "width": 1744, "height": 426, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1368426742, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 538981927, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_63", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": 198, "width": 1700, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 231897702, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1961269854, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - CLEAN BEFORE ANYTHING SENDS", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - CLEAN BEFORE ANYTHING SENDS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_64", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": 234, "width": 1700, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1685254564, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1709696036, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Every address is verified, bounces and catch-alls are suppressed instead of sent, and anyone already contacted or opted out is filtered out. This is what keeps the sending domains alive.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Every address is verified, bounces and catch-alls are suppressed instead of sent, and anyone already contacted or opted out is filtered out. This is what keeps the sending domains alive.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_65", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3174, "y": 30, "width": 1686, "height": 500, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1713601029, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1692732590, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_66", "type": "text", "x": 3196, "y": 46, "width": 1642, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 444688429, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2068124765, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - WRITE THE HUMAN VERSION", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - WRITE THE HUMAN VERSION", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_67", "type": "text", "x": 3196, "y": 82, "width": 1642, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1719888007, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 267352361, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Claude reads the actual property record or listing and writes the plain-text first line off what it found, picks the angle, then the lead drops into the seller or the agent sequence.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Claude reads the actual property record or listing and writes the plain-text first line off what it found, picks the angle, then the lead drops into the seller or the agent sequence.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_68", "type": "rectangle", "x": 5058, "y": -90, "width": 1542, "height": 938, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 818661758, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 289255806, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_69", "type": "text", "x": 5080, "y": -74, "width": 1498, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 896631051, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1892478002, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - REPLIES INTO YOUR CRM", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - REPLIES INTO YOUR CRM", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_70", "type": "text", "x": 5080, "y": -38, "width": 1498, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 697086886, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 472138490, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Every reply is read and sorted within minutes. Interested goes straight to the CRM with acquisitions alerted, questions go to a human, not now goes to nurture, remove is suppressed everywhere.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Every reply is read and sorted within minutes. Interested goes straight to the CRM with acquisitions alerted, questions go to a human, not now goes to nurture, remove is suppressed everywhere.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_71", "type": "rectangle", "x": 6798, "y": 54, "width": 1048, "height": 354, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8fd0d8", "backgroundColor": "#e4f7f9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1460519318, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 225810526, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_72", "type": "text", "x": 6820, "y": 70, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 439717025, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1001929, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - NUMBERS AND NOTHING FAILS QUIETLY", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 - NUMBERS AND NOTHING FAILS QUIETLY", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_73", "type": "text", "x": 6820, "y": 106, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 649677952, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 435786141, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "One scorecard row a day with sent, bounce, reply, positive and appointments, so scaling is a decision off real numbers. If any step fails\nyou get told which node and which record.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "One scorecard row a day with sent, bounce, reply, positive and appointments, so scaling is a decision off real numbers. If any step fails\nyou get told which node and which record.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 288, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2d6a4f", "backgroundColor": "#b7e4c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_74"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_75"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 320.625, "width": 256, "height": 19, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207388625, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 